{"id":"sh/l47i1kz2","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":65,"width":1184,"height":66},"text":"Checks that make the comparisons inspectable","style":{"fontSize":42,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/10zypgrq","kind":"shape","position":{"left":48,"top":678,"width":1184,"height":1},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#343B3B","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/0zqhwbq5","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":691,"width":1010,"height":19},"text":"NASA Space Apps 2026 · Planet X and SPHEREx","style":{"fontSize":14,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/zyhgn69k","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":1168,"top":689,"width":70,"height":23},"text":"5 / 7","style":{"fontSize":16,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/ex8zu18f","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":145,"width":1184,"height":68},"text":"We checked the processed images against their source files and tested alignment against an external star catalog. The checks answer different questions.","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#AFB6BA","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/dwzylgru","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":247,"width":552,"height":55},"text":"189 image records","style":{"fontSize":43,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/sv6hsba9","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":310,"width":552,"height":28},"text":"SOURCE-FILE CONSISTENCY","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/raxgj69o","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":356,"width":552,"height":224},"text":"The 14–15 November processing sweep covered 183 unique cutouts plus six case re-renders. A separate code path recomputed wavelengths, timestamps, quality flags, coverage, display mapping and source records. The results matched the published products, so the displayed evidence can be traced back to the original files.","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/q9ofq1s3","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":670,"top":252,"width":562,"height":92},"text":"128 PASS · 55 UNKNOWN · 0 FAIL","style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/xsjyx0ry","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":670,"top":344,"width":562,"height":27},"text":"183 UNIQUE CUTOUTS · EXTERNAL ALIGNMENT","style":{"fontSize":17,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#D7FC70","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/wrah4vqd","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":670,"top":391,"width":562,"height":194},"text":"Independent field-star detections were compared with Gaia DR3 positions. PASS means the alignment met the validator’s thresholds; UNKNOWN means too few usable stars supported a verdict. Unknown cases stay visible as uncertainty. This check tests the sky grid separately from the moving target.","style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/u1kn2tkj","kind":"shape","position":{"left":48,"top":588,"width":1184,"height":1},"geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#343B3B","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/v2t4byl4","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":48,"top":607,"width":295,"height":32},"text":"Deliberate error test","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0},
{"id":"sh/w325432p","kind":"textbox","position":{"left":363,"top":605,"width":869,"height":57},"text":"The validator rejected every injected 1-, 2- and 5-native-pixel shift on the three tested real-frame fixtures.","style":{"fontSize":22.51,"typeface":"Avenir Next","color":"#F5F6F5","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0}
]}
